  "term": "bulimia",
  "definition": "Bulimia is a mental health disorder marked by repeated episodes of binge eating during which the person feels unable to control the eating, followed by repeated behaviors to avoid weight gain, often self-induced vomiting. A person’s self-worth is also overly shaped by body image.",
